%% Event delivery: transactional outbox, at-least-once delivery, idempotent consumers, dead letter after the retry budget.
flowchart LR
  TX[API transaction<br/>state change + audit row + outbox row] --> OB[(outbox_event<br/>status PENDING)]
  OB --> W{worker<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED}
  W -->|handler ok| DONE[(DELIVERED)]
  W -->|error, attempts < 8| RETRY[(PENDING, next_attempt_at = backoff)]
  RETRY --> W
  W -->|attempts exhausted| DLQ[(DEAD_LETTER<br/>visible to admins)]
  W --> RM[room_read_model]
  W --> NT[notification]
